# camoufox-js service-tester proxy list.
#
# Format: one proxy per line: user:pass@domain:port
# Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# Proxies are assigned round-robin to the 6 test profiles; fewer is fine.
#
# Copy this file to proxies.txt and fill in real values:
#   cp proxies.txt.example proxies.txt
#
# Example:
# alice:secret123@proxy1.example.com:10000
# bob:hunter2@proxy2.example.com:10000
# alice:secret123@proxy1.example.com:10001
